  (text "BOARD NOTES" (at 532.1300 182.8800 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid f02e502a-da30-4165-9c93-288aad453c9c))
  (text "REAR BOARD, EVT1 DRAFT FOR REVIEW\n2 layers, 2 oz. One reinforced barrier: 8.0 mm creepage and clearance, crossed only by U5, PS1, K1, K2.\nNet classes: MAINS = L_BUS, N_IN, E_IN, N_F, N_R, L_OUT1/2 and every H_* net.  SAFE = everything else.\nMAINS to SAFE >= 8.0 mm; MAINS to E_IN >= 3.0 mm; L to N >= 3.0 mm with slots where traces converge.\nOutlet paths sized for 20 A combined (IPC-2152). No connector on the hot side.\nBench rule: never power this board from the mains without an isolation transformer and an RCD." (at 532.1300 186.6900 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid d7617970-972d-4782-b218-0ee570836f7b))
